        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Mirella was amazing, wasn't planning on going in but online kept giving error messages when trying to add a vehicle. Good thing I stopped in as she found me multiple extra discounts. Real people will always beat online experience.",
        "time": 1705155238,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carole Perron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109689044656371255663/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKlxI3SKLWxk86oAKsajkMtqmQEXMdjN6H25ZR2tHe0W33WA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I gave personal information on the phone for 45 minutes in order to obtain a quote. No one ever followed up or generated a quote. When i called back they had no record of the entire call or request for quote. Imagine how bad their claim service must be? Don’t waste your time with cooperators",
        "time": 1685973956,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "R Shanks",
