        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I am leaving a 5 star review specifically for you Maelle! She was really helpful, patient and made the painful experience so pleasant.\nThanks again!",
        "time": 1701376263,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie-Anne Dupuis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115523503268128042658/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7tS9aa810JqhSWFPSl6iIyMnReKnDjv69Y30CU3GYx8DTtDal=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Best experience I have ever had with any insurance company. They offer all types of insurance and provide advice and complete information in the most professional and friendly manner. I absolutely recommend this company and the Vaudreuil branch specifically!",
        "time": 1501786899,
        "translated": false
      },
